<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian central bank seen selling 3-mth dlrs.</title>
<headline>Indonesian central bank seen selling 3-mth dlrs.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian central bank, Bank Indonesia, was seen selling three-month dollar forward at the 2,685 level, dealers said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;I heard the central bank is offering three-month forwards at the 2,685 level,&quot; one Japanese bank dealer said.</p>
<p>Spot rupiah was quoted at 2,620/30 at 0635 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
